{"id":"1e5d7c3f7413640b","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-total-order.md","title":"total-order","display":"df-total-order — total-order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-total-order","aliases":["57-df-total-order"],"display":"df-total-order — total-order","depends_on":["[[57-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-total-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-total-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-total-order — total-order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71716214f566b7aa\" href=\"?note=71716214f566b7aa\" title=\"57-df-relation\">57-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上的严格二元关系；关系记法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71716214f566b7aa\" href=\"?note=71716214f566b7aa\" title=\"57-df-relation\">57-df-relation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LO}\">\\(\\mathrm{LO}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalOrder}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalOrder}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(A,&lt;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;&lt;\\;\\subseteq A^2\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\neg(x&lt;x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;(x&lt;y\\land y&lt;z\\to x&lt;z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\ne y\\to x&lt;y\\lor y&lt;x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LO}(A,&lt;)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(A,&lt;).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(A,&lt;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;&lt;\\;\\subseteq A^2\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\neg(x&lt;x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;(x&lt;y\\land y&lt;z\\to x&lt;z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\ne y\\to x&lt;y\\lor y&lt;x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LO}(A,&lt;)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(A,&lt;).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目按第 57 册原引用处所需接口在内部补齐；背景为 ZFC。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"71716214f566b7aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"71716214f566b7aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$<$ 为 $A$ 上的严格二元关系；关系记法见 [[57-df-relation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LO}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalOrder}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(A,<)\\leftrightarrow{}&<\\;\\subseteq A^2\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\neg(x<x)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;(x<y\\land y<z\\to x<z)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\ne y\\to x<y\\lor y<x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LO}(A,<)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(A,<).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":956,"backlinks":[{"id":"59981a2d27254902","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"假定 $\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(A,<_A)$，见 [[57-df-total-order]]。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 保留原“稠密”条件；$\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 独立记录后续定理需要的无端点条件，不并入原谓词。"},{"id":"9a1792a4c383672b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TotalOrder}$ 见 [[57-df-total-order]]。另外定义 $\\mathrm{OrdField}$、$\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}$，供确实需要通常有序实闭域条件的定理使用；二者不替代原 RCF 谓词。"},{"id":"80bd19d81f860e01","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_<$ 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$，没有常量及函数。$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_<}$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；两结构的 $<$ 解释均满足 [[57-df-total-order]] 的严格全序条件。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 和 $\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 取 [[57-df-dlo]]。$|A|=|B|=\\aleph_0$；$\\cong$ 取 [[57-df-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"96557e0d89e19386","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_<$ 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$，没有常量及函数。$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_<}$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；两结构的 $<$ 解释均满足 [[57-df-total-order]] 的严格全序条件。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 和 $\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 取 [[57-df-dlo]]。$\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{DLO}}$ 为满足 $\\mathrm{DLO}\\land\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 的固定 $S_<$-结构。本文件无参数的 $\\mathrm{DLO}$ 保留原理论对象写法，定义为 $\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{DLO}})$；不与结构谓词 $\\mathrm{DLO}(\\mathfrak A)$ 混淆。$g$ 为 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的有效编码，$\\mathrm{Dec}$ 取标准 Hilbert 演算下的 [[57-df-decidable-theory]]。"},{"id":"71233b52551503c6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$S_<$ 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$，没有常量及函数。$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_<}$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；两结构的 $<$ 解释均满足 [[57-df-total-order]] 的严格全序条件。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 和 $\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 取 [[57-df-dlo]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_<}$；$\\mathrm{QF}_{S_<}$ 见 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]。固定变量 $z$。由于纯序语言没有闭项或原始真值常量，允许消去后用 $z\\doteq z$ 或 $\\neg(z\\doteq z)$ 表达恒真或恒假，故允许这个辅助自由变量。$\\models$ 对开公式使用全称赋值语义。"},{"id":"83fa8e237c5c3ddb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_<$ 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$，没有常量及函数。$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_<}$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；两结构的 $<$ 解释均满足 [[57-df-total-order]] 的严格全序条件。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 和 $\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 取 [[57-df-dlo]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$A,B$ 为非空有限集合。$\\equiv_n$ 保持 [[57-df-n-equivalence]] 对所有开公式的全称赋值版本；$W_n$ 为 [[57-df-ef-game]] 的递归获胜位置集。$\\varepsilon$ 为空元组。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-ax-substitution-schema]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-family]]\n[[57-df-finite-subset]]\n[[57-df-finite]]\n[[57-df-function-restriction]]\n[[57-df-function-symbol]]\n[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]\n[[57-df-indexed-product]]\n[[57-df-infinite]]\n[[57-df-injective]]\n[[57-df-mgu]]\n[[57-df-natural-number]]\n[[57-df-omega]]\n[[57-df-ordered-pair]]\n[[57-df-partial-function]]\n[[57-df-pow-fin]]\n[[57-df-range]]\n[[57-df-relation-domain]]\n[[57-df-relation-symbol]]\n[[57-df-relation]]\n[[57-df-sequent-rule]]\n[[57-df-set-function]]\n[[57-df-set]]\n[[57-df-total-order]]\n[[57-df-ultrafilter-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-universal-closure]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-d